<div id="pf1d" class="pf w0 h0" data-page-no="1d"><div class="pc pc1d w0 h0"><img class="bi x3 y2fe w3 h3c" alt="" src="bg1d.png"/><div class="t m0 x3 he y30 ff9 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">7<span class="_ _7e"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _16"> </span>应用层<span class="_ _8b"> </span><span class="ff3">7.3<span class="_ _12"> </span></span>电子邮件<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Electronic Mail)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y7e ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">7.3<span class="_ _24"> </span><span class="ff1">电子邮件<span class="_ _5"> </span></span>(Electronic<span class="_ _9"> </span>Mail)</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y1a4 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.3.1<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">核心通信过程</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y1a5 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">根据邮件的流向，电子邮件系统的工作过程可分为两个主要阶段：</div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y1c7 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">邮件推送<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Pushing)<span class="ff4">：</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y2ff ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">方向<span class="ff4">：发送方用户<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">→<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>发送方服务器<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">→<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>接收方服务器。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y300 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">协议<span class="ff4">：使用<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">SMTP<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Simple<span class="_ _0"> </span>Mail<span class="_ _0"> </span>T<span class="_ _29"></span>ransfer<span class="_ _7e"> </span>Protocol<span class="ff4">，简单邮件传输协议</span>)<span class="ff4">。</span></span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y301 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">特点<span class="ff4">：<span class="ff3">SMTP<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>只能用于</span>发送<span class="ff4">邮件（推）<span class="_ _2"></span>，不能用于接收。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y302 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">邮件拉取<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Pulling)<span class="ff4">：</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y303 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">方向<span class="ff4">：接收方服务器<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">→<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>接收方用户。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y304 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">协议<span class="ff4">：使用<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">POP3<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>或<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">IMAP</span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y305 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">特点<span class="ff4">：因为接收方不知道邮件何时到达，所以必须由用户主动向服务器</span>请求<span class="ff4">（拉）邮件。</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y306 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.3.2<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">协议对比详解</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y307 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.3.2.1<span class="_ _32"> </span>1.<span class="_ _12"> </span>SMTP<span class="_ _28"> </span>(<span class="ff1">简单邮件传输协议</span>)</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y308 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">端口<span class="ff4">：<span class="ff3">TCP<span class="_ _0"> </span>25</span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y309 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">作用<span class="ff4">：用于用户代理向邮件服务器发送邮件，以及邮件服务器之间的邮件传输。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y30a ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">局限<span class="ff4">：它是纯文本协议（只能传<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">ASCII<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>码）<span class="_ _2"></span>，传输非文本内容需使用<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">**MIME**<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>进行扩展。</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y30b ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.3.2.2<span class="_ _32"> </span>2.<span class="_ _12"> </span><span class="ff1">邮件读取协议：</span>POP3<span class="_ _28"> </span>vs<span class="_ _28"> </span>IMAP</div><div class="t m0 x64 h6 y30c ff1 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">表<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">7.1:<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">POP3<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">与<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>IMAP<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">的区别</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x8b h6 y30d ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">特性<span class="_ _8c"> </span><span class="ff6">POP3<span class="_ _0"> </span>(</span>邮局协议版本<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">3)<span class="_ _8d"> </span>IMAP<span class="_ _0"> </span>(</span>网际报文存取协议<span class="ff6">)</span></div><div class="t m0 x8b h6 y30e ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">工作模式<span class="_ _3a"> </span>下载并删除<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(<span class="ff4">默认</span>)<span class="_ _79"> </span></span>服务器同步</div><div class="t m0 x8b h6 y30f ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">邮件管理<span class="_ _3a"> </span><span class="ff4">在本地主机上管理<span class="_ _8e"> </span>在邮件服务器上管理</span></div><div class="t m0 x8b h6 y310 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">多端同步<span class="_ _3a"> </span><span class="ff4">不支持<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(</span>换电脑看不到旧邮件<span class="ff3">)<span class="_ _8f"> </span></span></span>支持<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(<span class="ff4">多端状态完全一致</span>)</span></div><div class="t m0 x8b h6 y311 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">离线阅读<span class="_ _3a"> </span><span class="ff4">支持<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(</span>下载后阅读<span class="ff3">)<span class="_ _79"> </span></span>部分支持<span class="_ _7e"> </span><span class="ff3">(</span>需预先缓存<span class="ff3">)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y312 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.3.3<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">通信模型图解</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y313 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">发送方用户<span class="_ _47"> </span>发送方服务器<span class="_ _5a"> </span>接收方服务器<span class="_ _47"> </span>接收方用户</div><div class="t m0 xa3 h2d y314 ff6 fs1 fca sc0 ls0 ws0">SMTP</div><div class="t m0 x79 h3d y315 ff3 fs7 fca sc0 ls0 ws0">(<span class="ff4">推</span>)</div><div class="t m0 x30 h2d y314 ff6 fs1 fca sc0 ls0 ws0">SMTP</div><div class="t m0 x29 h3d y315 ff3 fs7 fca sc0 ls0 ws0">(<span class="ff4">推</span>)</div><div class="t m0 xa4 h2d y314 ff6 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0">POP3/IMAP</div><div class="t m0 xa5 h3d y315 ff3 fs7 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0">(<span class="ff4">拉</span>)</div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y316 ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">7.4<span class="_ _24"> </span>URL</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y317 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.4.1<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">基本定义</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y318 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">URL<span class="ff4">（统一资源定位符）用于在互联网上定位唯一的资源。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y319 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">组成<span class="ff4">：由以冒号隔开的两大部分组成。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y31a ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">大小写规范<span class="ff4">：在<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">URL<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>中的字符对大写或小写没有特别要求（通常视为不区分大小写）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x3 he y5f ff9 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc7"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">24<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc9"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
